NorwayProfile=Install Norwegian chart of accounts
NorwayProfileScope=Norwegian chart with 745 accounts from Odoo l10n_no (LGPL-3), pinned to a documented revision. Confirmed installation creates and selects the chart for an empty accounting setup. An empty stock selection can be replaced only when the entity has no accounts or ledger history. Existing accounts or history are not replaced. No default accounts, tax codes or SAF-T mapping are set. Review suitability for your business; this is not a complete or professionally approved accounting solution.
NorwayProfileConfirm=Install or complete Norwegian chart
NorwayProfileInstalled=Norwegian chart selected. Created %s new accounts. Check default accounts, journals and VAT setup separately.
