NorwayWizardBody11=Review the setup and record what still needs to be resolved.
NorwayWizardLimit11=This is the final guidance page, not a completion button. No overall green status is calculated. Unfinished VAT, EHF, SAF-T and history support are delivery gaps that cannot be approved by clicking next.
